WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
See partial unit coverage
One of three units has test delivery evidence. Two still wait. Packing,
physical progress and the full order state are separate; automatic
updates remain paused.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Verify the fact before saving
Only a permitted store reviewer can confirm a parcel. Choose the actual
outcome, known event time and explicit live/test mode; explain
verification. This form is shown before submission.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Inspect your own seller group
The vendor reads only its approved store workspace and purchased seller
quantities. Its editable tracking claim cannot provide independent store
delivery confirmation.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Oversee without changing the proof
Platform admins inspect partial quantities, test provenance and
reconciliation readiness. Normal oversight has no store-confirmation,
packing or retry mutation controls.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Understand what has arrived
The buyer sees one of three units received and the other parcel waiting.
Payment collection remains separate. Retained partial handoff removes
cancellation and blocks payment replacement.
